PROPERTY HUB — FINAL MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

You are a senior Android application developer, UI/UX designer, and software architect. Build a complete, production-quality native Android application named Property Hub.

The application is an offline property data collection, poster generation, and file management tool. It allows users to save house rental and land sale advertisements as TXT records, automatically generate JPG posters, generate posters in bulk from previously saved records, and export generated posters as ZIP archives.

Do not build just a UI prototype. Implement all screens, navigation, storage operations, poster rendering, settings persistence, bulk processing, and ZIP export as working features.

