5. STORAGE LOCATION AND DIRECTORY STRUCTURE

Use Android Storage Access Framework (SAF).

When the user first opens the application, or when no storage directory has been selected, ask the user to choose a parent directory using:

"ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT_TREE"

Persist the URI permission using "takePersistableUriPermission()".

Do not depend on deprecated direct external storage APIs.

Do not request unnecessary MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permission.

After the user selects the parent directory, create and manage the following structure:

Property Hub/
│
├── House for Rent/
│   ├── 2026-11-26.txt
│   ├── 2026-11-27.txt
│   └── ...
│
├── Land for Sale/
│   ├── 2026-11-26.txt
│   ├── 2026-11-27.txt
│   └── ...
│
├── Generated Posters/
│   ├── House for Rent/
│   │   ├── House_001.jpg
│   │   ├── House_002.jpg
│   │   └── ...
│   │
│   └── Land for Sale/
│       ├── Land_001.jpg
│       ├── Land_002.jpg
